# Git Ignore for Antigravity 2.0 Repository
#
# Large packaged binaries under windows_application_files/ ARE tracked
# intentionally, via Git LFS (see .gitattributes). The old blanket
# ignores below are therefore negated for that directory.

*.exe
*.dll
*.pak
*.bin
*.dat
*.asar
*.zip
*.7z

# Dependencies
node_modules/
dist/node_modules/

# OS specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Negations: keep the packaged Windows payload tracked ---
!windows_application_files/
!windows_application_files/**
!windows_application_files/**/node_modules/
!windows_application_files/**/node_modules/**

